{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17398","headline":"从事淮南府过亡友杨校书旧厅感念愀然 · 权德舆","name":"从事淮南府过亡友杨校书旧厅感念愀然","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人随化往，倏忽今六霜。\n及我就拘限，清风留此堂。\n松竹逾映蔚，芝兰自销亡。\n绝弦罢流水，闻笛同山阳。\n熲如冰玉姿，粲若鸾凤章。\n欲翥摧劲翮，先秋落贞芳。\n正平赋鹦鹉，文考颂灵光。\n二子古不吊，夫君今何伤。\n黄墟既杳杳，玄化亦茫茫。\n岂必限宿草，含凄洒衣裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}